  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "Figure 2, 'Different illustrative formats of DDCC:VS'. Two existing paper formats: 1, the International Certificate of Vaccination or Prophylaxis (the yellow card); 2, a national immunization home-based record, pictured as a COVID-19 vaccination record card. Then, grouped under Digital Documentation of COVID-19 Certificates: Vaccination Status: 3, a handwritten paper certificate with only an HCID that links to a DDCC:VS, or with a 2D barcode containing the full DDCC:VS core data set; 4, a PDF print-out certificate with only an HCID linking to a DDCC:VS, or with a 2D barcode containing the full core data set; 5, a DDCC:VS held on a smartphone. Formats 3-5 are pictured as a 'National COVID-19 Certificate' with a QR code.",
